      ],
      "image": "assets/images/93290/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cake mix, pumpkin puree, cinnamon, nutmeg, and cloves in a large bowl until no dry spots remain and the batter is smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VMJGYQHRViG22aBe8PD9qtw4GAY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/93290-easy-pumpkin-muffins-VAT-Step-02-825351a162754a3d891c7838a34d3bdb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/93290/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon equal amounts of batter into the prepared muffin cups.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3xs-VEb-hABNdEPKlqhj9xDftTk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/93290-easy-pumpkin-muffins-VAT-Step-03-e49aaacbc330478a81090b658a443f99.jpg"
